          ],
          "content": "4. Expand (i) $( a + a b - 3 b ^ { 2 } ) \\; ( 4 + b ) , \\mathrm { a n d } \\; ( \\mathrm { i i } ) \\; ( 4 y + 7 ) \\; ( y + 1 1 z - 3 ) .$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.152,
            0.113,
            0.735,
            0.174
          ],
          "content": "**Ans.** (i) ${ \\begin{array} { r l } & { \\left( a + a b - 3 b ^ { 2 } \\right) ( 4 + b ) } \\\\ & { \\quad = 4 ( a + a b - 3 b ^ { 2 } ) + b ( a + a b - 3 b ^ { 2 } ) } \\\\ & { \\quad = 4 a + 4 a b - 1 2 b ^ { 2 } + a b + a b ^ { 2 } - 3 b ^ { 3 } } \\\\ & { \\quad = 4 a + 5 a b + a b ^ { 2 } - 1 2 b ^ { 2 } - 3 b ^ { 3 } } \\end{array} }$"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.201,
            0.18,
            0.738,
            0.247
          ],
          "content": "\\begin{aligned}( ii ) \\; (4y + 7) \\; (y + 11z - 3) &= 4y \\; (y + 11z - 3) + 7 \\; (y + 11z - 3) \\\\&= 4y^2 + 44yz - 12y + 7y + 77z - 21 \\\\&= 4y^2 + 44yz + 77z - 5y - 21\\end{aligned}",
          "image_source": "images/page_25_equation_2.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.256,
            0.848,
            0.332
          ],
          "content": "5. Expand (i) $( a ~ - ~ b ) ~ ( a ~ + ~ b ) ,$ , (ii) $( a ~ - ~ b ) ~ ( a ^ { 2 } ~ + ~ a b ~ + ~ b ^ { 2 } )$ and (iii) $(a - b)(a^{3} + a^{2}b + ab^{2} + b^{3})$ , Do you see a pattern? What would be the next identity in the pattern that you see? Can you check it by expanding?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.152,
            0.339,
            0.205,
            0.356
          ],
          "content": "**Ans.**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.212,
            0.361,
            0.318,
            0.381
          ],
          "content": "(i) $a ^ { 2 } - b ^ { 2 }$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.205,
            0.385,
            0.317,
            0.405
          ],
          "content": "(ii) $a ^ { 3 } - b ^ { 3 }$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.2,
            0.409,
            0.317,
            0.429
          ],
          "content": "(iii) $a ^ { 4 }   -   b ^ { 4 }$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.201,
            0.431,
            0.416,
            0.449
          ],
          "content": "Yes, a pattern is seen."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.202,
            0.451,
            0.499,
            0.469
          ],
          "content": "Next identity in the pattern is"
